        "original_id": "c3ff09d7-8302-5630-b21d-facb25e54d34",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\", \"Should've Been Me\", \"Views\"\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Naughty Boy, Popcaan\n- Roles: Canadian rapper, South African record producer, disk jockey, British singer, British record producer\n\nFacts:\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper, and \"One Dance\" is a song from his fourth studio album \"Views\" released in 2016.\n- Themba Sekowe, born in 1988, is popularly known as DJ Maphorisa.\n- DJ Maphorisa is a South African record producer and disk jockey who can sometimes feature vocals in songs.\n- Kyla is a British singer best known for her song \"Do You Mind\".\n- Kyla's song \"Do You Mind\" became one of the most successful charting UK funky songs and was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".\n- \"Should've Been Me\" is a song by British record producer Naughty Boy featuring vocals from Kyla and Popcaan.",
